 Deol","Brielle Barbusca","Shelby Yardley","Michael Villar","Tommy Walker","Mcabe Gregg","Junes Zahdi","Allegra Edwards","Martha Hackett","Adam Shapiro","Gilberto Ortiz","Richa Moorjani","Taťjana Čechova","Kate Amundsen","Lovlee Carroll","J.J. Nolan","James William O'Halloran","Aaron Scotti","David Weisenberg","Jarrod Crawford","Nikea Gamby-Turner","Kimleigh Smith","Philip Labes","Jonathan Kehoe","Tracey Wigfield","Nanrisa Lee","Michael D. Cohen","Mort Burke","Bonnie Bailey-Reed","Brandon Morales","Claudia Choi","Ravi Naidu","Brooke Dillman","Rebecca Ann Johnson","Tyler the Creator","Joe Canale","Dana White","Gita Reddy","Christopher Nicholas Smith","Ishmel Sahid","Keeshan Giles","Jennifer Daley","Tom Lucein","Shawne Merriman","Sammy Courtright","Jason Sims-Prewitt","Anita Kalathara","Katya Lidsky","Jack J. Bennett","Ronnie Clark","Ryan Shrime","Rachel Quaintance","Sheldon Bailey","Paull Walia","Matt Knudsen","Bruce M. Stockert","Susan Slome","Donnell Turner","Wayne Lopez","Chinedu Unaka","Zaire Adams","Zacharias Tapp II","Haley Bri Powell","Jane Macfie","Shantiel Alexis Vazquez","Bruce Katzman","Jonathan Roumie","Comfort Fedoke","Scout Durwood","Chris Schleicher","Thom Rivera","Terrell Carter","Vahe Bejan","Jillian Nelson","George Ketsios","Nina Millin","Chelsea Gonzalez","Katarína Pavelek","Maile Flanagan","Declan Churchill Carter","Terrence Terrell","Lisa Mason Lee","Jessie Cohen","Lynette DuPree","Oscar Best","Shannon McClung","Guy Branum","Zac Leveque","Shaan Sharma","Alexandra Grossi","Kirsta Peterson","Tara Alexandra Brown","Michael Durrell","Zach Selwyn","Kristian Kordula","Chris Spinelli","Aishwarya Pillai","Lauren Cook","Alan Heitz","Natasha Kojic","Noel Gibson"],"screenwriters":["Ike Barinholtz","David Stassen","Matt Warburton","Charlie Grandy","B. J. Novak","Jack Burditt","Mindy Kaling","Jeremy Bronson","Chris McKenna","Tucker Cawley","Adam Countee","Lang Fisher","Sonia Kharkar","Josh Bycel","Jonathan Fener","Alina Mankin","Tracey Wigfield","Mackenzie Dohr","Meredith Dawson","Jonathan Green","Harper Dill","Chris Schleicher","Guy Branum"],"cinematographers":["Marco Fargnoli","Frank Barrera","Patrick Rousseau","Vilmos Zsigmond"],"composers":["Jesse Novak"],"reviews":[{"author":"anusha","text":"sexy doktor, hlboko zraneny sarkasticky doktor a mlada romanticka ktora vela rozprava nema idealne BMI  a ma kopec casu na to aby stretavala chlapov chodila na party a nejakym vysetreniam sa venuje asi tak 0,5% casu v serialy, ma obrovsky byt v new yorku a je to super vtipne “I hooked you up with Ronaldo!” “Your garbage man? He was smokin’ hot, but he was a little pretentious. A little too well-read, if I may say that.”\n\nupdate: po 2 dnoch a dvoch seriach zvysujem hodnotie na 5* a kto to vzal pri prvych epizodach odporucam pri tom zostat .. pokial ste teda zena :)(18.09.2014)","stars":5},{"author":"Chen","text":"Nakonec se z toho vyklubal onen typ seriálu, který se na počátku hledá, ale postupem času se z něj stane povedená podívaná. Humor je štiplavý, příjemně drzý, ale zbytečně netlačí na pilu (alespoň ne většinou). Mindy Kaling zúročila své zkušenosti z psaní scénářů k některým epizodám Kanclu a přestože styl humoru The Mindy Project je malinko jiný, funguje.(26.09.2012)","stars":4},{"author":"quip","text":"Po první sezóně je to úplně jasné - hůř napsaný seriál jsem neviděl. Příběhově občas překvapí (aha, tohle se stalo?), motivace zejména postav Mindy (Kaling) a Dannyho (Messina) jsou hrubě nečitelné nebo spíš \"all over the place\" a chovají se jako idioti. Taky se divím, že Mindy Kaling napsala svoje alter-ego takhle otravně. Přitom premisa zněla opravdu sympaticky a některé postavy jsou také. Chtělo by to možná víc writerů - takhle to musí být celkem fuška a výsledek navíc vypadá takhle odfláknutě.(02.11.2013)","stars":2}],"vods":[{"platform":"Prime Video","url":"https://www.primevideo.com/detail/amzn1.dv.gti.50a9f663-f6da-6198-a468-1d06eaa71645"}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/316899-the-mindy-project/prehled/","cs